{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zenith Realms is a 3D top-down cozy adventure puzzle game where Ninami embarks on an emotional journey across the fractured realms of a splintering planet. Can you help Ninami and find the way home before time runs out?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER A SPLITTING WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world that is undergoing a planetary mitosis after duplicating everything on its surface, a war had struck between the two sides  and led to the death of all but one: <strong>Ninami</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162120/extras/the_Hub.png?t=1745400760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel the tranquil yet divided landscapes of the Zenith Realms on a quest to get Ninami back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162120/extras/split_levels.png?t=1745400760\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FACE CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overcome adversaries by chasing the mischievous Raven who stole  the  gem that powers Ninami's Home portal, and learn about their shared troubled past.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162120/extras/chasing_raven.png?t=1745400760\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNRAVEL MYSTERIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By solving intriguing environmental puzzles, you learn more about the planetary split and explore three beautiful levels full of pre-war history, friendly creatures, and a dark secret past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162120/extras/cubies.png?t=1745400760\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162120/extras/puzzle.png?t=1745400760\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3162120?t=1745400760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745400760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162120/ddf44da33b2220b0adfd135611962946aa0fac50/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745400760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162120/ddf44da33b2220b0adfd135611962946aa0fac50/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745400760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zenith Realms is a 3D top-down cozy adventure puzzle game where Ninami embarks on an emotional journey across the fractured realms of a splintering planet. Can you help Ninami and find the way home before time runs out?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER A SPLITTING WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world that is undergoing a planetary mitosis after duplicating everything on its surface, a war had struck between the two sides  and led to the death of all but one: <strong>Ninami</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162120/extras/the_Hub.png?t=1745400760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel the tranquil yet divided landscapes of the Zenith Realms on a quest to get Ninami back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162120/extras/split_levels.png?t=1745400760\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FACE CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overcome adversa